{"id":"vol9-05","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-05/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":412.01,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.32,"text":"Do you have some time to look at questions 21 to 24?","words":[["Do",0.0,0.1],["you",0.1,0.22],["have",0.22,0.34],["some",0.34,0.5],["time",0.5,0.88],["to",0.88,1.16],["look",1.16,1.32],["at",1.32,1.44],["questions",1.44,1.78],["21",1.78,2.56],["to",2.56,2.84],["24?",2.84,3.32]]},{"start":23.93,"end":27.77,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.","words":[["Now",23.93,24.13],["listen",24.13,24.43],["carefully",24.43,24.89],["and",24.89,25.25],["answer",25.25,25.59],["questions",25.59,26.01],["21",26.01,26.85],["to",26.85,27.17],["24.",27.17,27.77]]},{"start":31.39,"end":34.01,"text":"Hi Annie, Ryan, come in.","words":[["Hi",31.39,32.07],["Annie,",32.07,32.67],["Ryan,",33.03,33.27],["come",33.61,33.83],["in.",33.83,34.01]]},{"start":34.25,"end":34.59,"text":"Morning.","words":[["Morning.",34.25,34.59]]},{"start":35.63,"end":38.73,"text":"I know you want to discuss your project presentation.","words":[["I",35.63,35.99],["know",35.99,36.27],["you",36.27,36.45],["want",36.45,36.61],["to",36.61,36.77],["discuss",36.77,37.07],["your",37.07,37.41],["project",37.41,37.95],["presentation.",37.95,38.73]]},{"start":39.37,"end":42.35,"text":"Start by reminding me what you're focusing on.","words":[["Start",39.37,39.79],["by",39.79,40.13],["reminding",40.13,40.59],["me",40.59,40.97],["what",40.97,41.43],["you're",41.43,41.63],["focusing",41.63,41.99],["on.",41.99,42.35]]},{"start":42.75,"end":47.71,"text":"We've been looking at a research article on the disposal of hazardous household waste.","words":[["We've",42.75,43.09],["been",43.09,43.21],["looking",43.21,43.41],["at",43.41,43.63],["a",43.63,43.73],["research",43.73,44.11],["article",44.11,44.75],["on",44.75,45.17],["the",45.17,45.29],["disposal",45.29,45.69],["of",45.69,46.17],["hazardous",46.17,46.57],["household",46.57,47.09],["waste.",47.09,47.71]]},{"start":47.89,"end":52.07,"text":"That includes things like dangerous chemicals we use in the home,","words":[["That",47.89,48.19],["includes",48.19,48.65],["things",48.65,49.09],["like",49.09,49.47],["dangerous",49.47,50.09],["chemicals",50.09,50.79],["we",50.79,51.25],["use",51.25,51.45],["in",51.45,51.59],["the",51.59,51.69],["home,",51.69,52.07]]},{"start":52.07,"end":58.23,"text":"but also less obvious items like electrical equipment, which are potentially really polluting","words":[["but",52.07,52.55],["also",52.55,52.89],["less",52.89,53.23],["obvious",53.23,53.73],["items",53.73,54.35],["like",54.35,54.79],["electrical",54.79,55.39],["equipment,",55.39,55.87],["which",56.27,56.49],["are",56.49,56.67],["potentially",56.67,57.17],["really",57.17,57.63],["polluting",57.63,58.23]]},{"start":58.23,"end":64.55,"text":"as well. The research basically involved interviews, trying to find out what influence","words":[["as",58.23,58.49],["well.",58.49,58.77],["The",59.51,59.67],["research",59.67,60.01],["basically",60.01,60.59],["involved",60.59,61.33],["interviews,",61.33,62.05],["trying",62.53,62.95],["to",62.95,63.19],["find",63.19,63.43],["out",63.43,63.77],["what",63.77,64.03],["influence",64.03,64.55]]},{"start":64.55,"end":70.15,"text":"the methods people use to get rid of their dangerous waste. There were some really surprising","words":[["the",64.55,65.05],["methods",65.05,65.45],["people",65.45,65.93],["use",65.93,66.37],["to",66.37,66.61],["get",66.61,66.77],["rid",66.77,66.97],["of",66.97,67.17],["their",67.17,67.31],["dangerous",67.31,67.75],["waste.",67.75,68.25],["There",68.79,69.07],["were",69.07,69.19],["some",69.19,69.37],["really",69.37,69.71],["surprising",69.71,70.15]]},{"start":70.15,"end":75.23,"text":"results about people's behaviour and attitudes with regard to waste disposal.","words":[["results",70.15,70.75],["about",70.75,71.29],["people's",71.29,71.89],["behaviour",71.89,72.19],["and",72.19,72.65],["attitudes",72.65,73.23],["with",73.23,73.73],["regard",73.73,74.13],["to",74.13,74.39],["waste",74.39,74.61],["disposal.",74.61,75.23]]},{"start":75.55,"end":75.89,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",75.55,75.89]]},{"start":76.39,"end":81.35,"text":"It's no great shock that in general people are much more aware than they used to be.","words":[["It's",76.39,76.83],["no",76.83,77.03],["great",77.03,77.25],["shock",77.25,77.61],["that",77.61,77.97],["in",77.97,78.15],["general",78.15,78.59],["people",78.59,79.03],["are",79.03,79.27],["much",79.27,79.57],["more",79.57,79.85],["aware",79.85,80.29],["than",80.29,80.53],["they",80.53,80.69],["used",80.69,80.97],["to",80.97,81.13],["be.",81.13,81.35]]},{"start":81.35,"end":87.85,"text":"you know, about the effects of these materials on the environment and about the value of","words":[["you",81.35,82.07],["know,",82.07,82.29],["about",82.79,83.05],["the",83.05,83.29],["effects",83.29,83.73],["of",83.73,84.01],["these",84.01,84.19],["materials",84.19,84.87],["on",84.87,85.11],["the",85.11,85.25],["environment",85.25,85.81],["and",85.81,86.77],["about",86.77,87.07],["the",87.07,87.25],["value",87.25,87.65],["of",87.65,87.85]]},{"start":87.85,"end":91.39,"text":"careful disposal, even the smallest, cheapest things.","words":[["careful",87.85,88.21],["disposal,",88.21,88.87],["even",89.33,89.57],["the",89.57,89.77],["smallest,",89.77,90.13],["cheapest",90.43,90.81],["things.",90.81,91.39]]},{"start":91.81,"end":97.67,"text":"Yes, but I did think it was surprising that people don't get very enthusiastic about the","words":[["Yes,",91.81,92.11],["but",92.67,92.85],["I",92.85,93.05],["did",93.05,93.25],["think",93.25,93.51],["it",93.51,93.71],["was",93.71,93.89],["surprising",93.89,94.55],["that",94.55,95.03],["people",95.03,95.31],["don't",95.31,95.65],["get",95.65,95.81],["very",95.81,96.09],["enthusiastic",96.09,96.75],["about",96.75,97.47],["the",97.47,97.67]]},{"start":97.67,"end":103.51,"text":"subject of waste disposal, like they do about other aspects of environmental protection.","words":[["subject",97.67,98.07],["of",98.07,98.39],["waste",98.39,98.69],["disposal,",98.69,99.49],["like",99.81,100.05],["they",100.05,100.25],["do",100.25,100.47],["about",100.47,100.77],["other",100.77,101.23],["aspects",101.23,101.75],["of",101.75,102.23],["environmental",102.23,102.77],["protection.",102.77,103.51]]},{"start":103.91,"end":104.53,"text":"Me too.","words":[["Me",103.91,104.23],["too.",104.23,104.53]]},{"start":105.15,"end":108.01,"text":"Apparently, they find it all rather tiresome.","words":[["Apparently,",105.15,105.67],["they",105.91,106.09],["find",106.09,106.45],["it",106.45,106.61],["all",106.61,106.87],["rather",106.87,107.17],["tiresome.",107.17,108.01]]},{"start":108.01,"end":113.11,"text":"Another striking thing was that many people are more careful when they're","words":[["Another",108.01,109.17],["striking",109.17,109.75],["thing",109.75,110.13],["was",110.13,110.83],["that",110.83,110.99],["many",110.99,111.23],["people",111.23,111.63],["are",111.63,111.81],["more",111.81,112.05],["careful",112.05,112.55],["when",112.55,112.83],["they're",112.83,113.11]]},{"start":113.11,"end":117.71,"text":"using certain hazardous materials than when they are getting rid of them.","words":[["using",113.11,113.51],["certain",113.51,114.13],["hazardous",114.13,114.53],["materials",114.53,115.41],["than",115.41,116.19],["when",116.19,116.39],["they",116.39,116.61],["are",116.61,116.69],["getting",116.69,116.93],["rid",116.93,117.25],["of",117.25,117.47],["them.",117.47,117.71]]},{"start":118.25,"end":122.97,"text":"At that stage, they simply don't remember that they'll be bad for the environment.","words":[["At",118.25,118.57],["that",118.57,118.75],["stage,",118.75,119.13],["they",119.37,119.57],["simply",119.57,119.97],["don't",119.97,120.29],["remember",120.29,120.89],["that",120.89,121.43],["they'll",121.43,121.65],["be",121.65,121.77],["bad",121.77,122.07],["for",122.07,122.25],["the",122.25,122.37],["environment.",122.37,122.97]]},{"start":123.55,"end":126.35,"text":"Absolutely. That really amazed us.","words":[["Absolutely.",123.55,124.09],["That",124.73,124.99],["really",124.99,125.47],["amazed",125.47,125.95],["us.",125.95,126.35]]},{"start":126.95,"end":132.47,"text":"I can see why. But were there any positives? Hope for the future?","words":[["I",126.95,127.23],["can",127.23,127.39],["see",127.39,127.65],["why.",127.65,127.99],["But",128.95,129.39],["were",129.39,129.61],["there",129.61,129.77],["any",129.77,130.01],["positives?",130.01,130.67],["Hope",131.63,131.81],["for",131.81,132.09],["the",132.09,132.17],["future?",132.17,132.47]]},{"start":132.47,"end":139.53,"text":"Well, in the conclusion section of the article, they talked about ways to improve recycling","words":[["Well,",132.47,133.37],["in",133.91,134.21],["the",134.21,134.43],["conclusion",134.43,134.95],["section",134.95,135.69],["of",135.69,136.09],["the",136.09,136.25],["article,",136.25,136.75],["they",137.11,137.27],["talked",137.27,137.51],["about",137.51,137.83],["ways",137.83,138.17],["to",138.17,138.45],["improve",138.45,138.93],["recycling",138.93,139.53]]},{"start":139.53,"end":141.11,"text":"rates in the local area.","words":[["rates",139.53,140.09],["in",140.09,140.29],["the",140.29,140.39],["local",140.39,140.59],["area.",140.59,141.11]]},{"start":141.49,"end":145.59,"text":"And I think some of the ideas would improve things around here, you know?","words":[["And",141.49,141.65],["I",141.65,141.91],["think",141.91,142.17],["some",142.17,142.47],["of",142.47,142.61],["the",142.61,142.71],["ideas",142.71,143.19],["would",143.19,143.43],["improve",143.43,143.85],["things",143.85,144.19],["around",144.19,144.51],["here,",144.51,144.93],["you",145.27,145.39],["know?",145.39,145.59]]},{"start":146.07,"end":151.81,"text":"The article talked about laws in certain countries that certain types of waste have","words":[["The",146.07,146.29],["article",146.29,146.63],["talked",146.63,146.99],["about",146.99,147.33],["laws",147.33,147.77],["in",147.77,148.23],["certain",148.23,148.69],["countries",148.69,149.27],["that",149.27,149.99],["certain",149.99,150.47],["types",150.47,150.87],["of",150.87,151.09],["waste",151.09,151.43],["have",151.43,151.81]]},{"start":151.81,"end":155.17,"text":"to be disposed of safely or you are taken to court.","words":[["to",151.81,151.99],["be",151.99,152.15],["disposed",152.15,152.71],["of",152.71,152.93],["safely",152.93,153.45],["or",153.45,153.97],["you",153.97,154.23],["are",154.23,154.35],["taken",154.35,154.61],["to",154.61,154.81],["court.",154.81,155.17]]},{"start":155.17,"end":161.63,"text":"I think financial penalties are a good idea, but criminalising people is too harsh.","words":[["I",155.17,155.89],["think",155.89,156.11],["financial",156.11,156.65],["penalties",156.65,157.51],["are",157.51,157.83],["a",157.83,157.93],["good",157.93,158.09],["idea,",158.09,158.53],["but",158.97,159.17],["criminalising",159.17,160.05],["people",160.05,160.51],["is",160.51,160.89],["too",160.89,161.13],["harsh.",161.13,161.63]]},{"start":162.51,"end":168.07,"text":"I think it's more effective to impose a penalty on homes if they don't recycle stuff.","words":[["I",162.51,162.79],["think",162.79,163.05],["it's",163.05,163.37],["more",163.37,163.61],["effective",163.61,164.11],["to",164.11,164.37],["impose",164.37,164.79],["a",164.79,164.99],["penalty",164.99,165.31],["on",165.31,165.69],["homes",165.69,166.23],["if",166.23,166.61],["they",166.61,166.77],["don't",166.77,167.01],["recycle",167.01,167.49],["stuff.",167.49,168.07]]},{"start":168.55,"end":174.97,"text":"I still think legislation forcing local councils to increase recycling rates works better.","words":[["I",168.55,168.83],["still",168.83,169.15],["think",169.15,169.55],["legislation",169.55,170.33],["forcing",170.33,171.15],["local",171.15,171.71],["councils",171.71,172.25],["to",172.25,172.53],["increase",172.53,172.97],["recycling",172.97,173.65],["rates",173.65,174.15],["works",174.15,174.41],["better.",174.41,174.97]]},{"start":175.55,"end":177.05,"text":"You can present both ideas.","words":[["You",175.55,175.73],["can",175.73,175.91],["present",175.91,176.27],["both",176.27,176.59],["ideas.",176.59,177.05]]},{"start":177.55,"end":179.59,"text":"Yeah, and agree to differ.","words":[["Yeah,",177.55,177.93],["and",178.41,178.63],["agree",178.63,178.99],["to",178.99,179.23],["differ.",179.23,179.59]]},{"start":179.59,"end":186.93,"text":"I think encouragement is always better in the long run and getting the local community involved","words":[["I",179.59,180.47],["think",180.47,181.69],["encouragement",181.69,182.43],["is",182.43,182.79],["always",182.79,183.03],["better",183.03,183.45],["in",183.45,183.65],["the",183.65,183.73],["long",183.73,183.93],["run",183.93,184.17],["and",184.17,185.01],["getting",185.01,185.31],["the",185.31,185.53],["local",185.53,185.75],["community",185.75,186.21],["involved",186.21,186.93]]},{"start":186.93,"end":193.53,"text":"such as schools, working with kids. That way you establish good habits which last throughout","words":[["such",186.93,187.41],["as",187.41,187.59],["schools,",187.59,188.03],["working",188.43,188.99],["with",188.99,189.23],["kids.",189.23,189.55],["That",190.29,190.61],["way",190.61,190.79],["you",190.79,190.97],["establish",190.97,191.51],["good",191.51,191.93],["habits",191.93,192.37],["which",192.37,192.83],["last",192.83,193.17],["throughout",193.17,193.53]]},{"start":193.53,"end":195.31,"text":"their lives. Okay.","words":[["their",193.53,193.91],["lives.",193.91,194.43],["Okay.",194.89,195.31]]},{"start":198.78,"end":204.3,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 25","words":[["Before",198.78,199.28],["you",199.28,199.54],["hear",199.54,199.76],["the",199.76,199.92],["rest",199.92,200.2],["of",200.2,200.34],["the",200.34,200.42],["discussion,",200.42,200.8],["you",201.34,201.58],["have",201.58,201.78],["some",201.78,201.98],["time",201.98,202.38],["to",202.38,202.6],["look",202.6,202.76],["at",202.76,202.92],["questions",202.92,203.26],["25",203.26,204.3]]},{"start":204.3,"end":238.94,"text":"to 30. Now listen and answer questions 25 to 30.","words":[["to",204.3,204.54],["30.",204.54,204.88],["Now",235.38,235.68],["listen",235.68,236.0],["and",236.0,236.42],["answer",236.42,236.78],["questions",236.78,237.2],["25",237.2,238.22],["to",238.22,238.56],["30.",238.56,238.94]]},{"start":238.94,"end":245.36,"text":"Do you want to talk through your actual presentation?","words":[["Do",238.94,240.0],["you",242.72,242.88],["want",242.88,243.04],["to",243.04,243.3],["talk",243.3,243.58],["through",243.58,243.88],["your",243.88,244.2],["actual",244.2,244.7],["presentation?",244.7,245.36]]},{"start":246.14,"end":253.76,"text":"Yes, we thought we'd talk about different types of waste covered in the research and give advice on each one.","words":[["Yes,",246.14,246.44],["we",246.76,247.06],["thought",247.06,247.44],["we'd",247.44,247.88],["talk",247.88,248.14],["about",248.14,248.46],["different",248.46,248.9],["types",248.9,249.46],["of",249.46,249.82],["waste",249.82,250.24],["covered",250.24,250.68],["in",250.68,250.96],["the",250.96,251.08],["research",251.08,251.56],["and",251.56,252.22],["give",252.22,252.56],["advice",252.56,253.02],["on",253.02,253.26],["each",253.26,253.46],["one.",253.46,253.76]]},{"start":254.26,"end":255.54,"text":"That's a great idea.","words":[["That's",254.26,254.72],["a",254.72,254.82],["great",254.82,255.14],["idea.",255.14,255.54]]},{"start":255.82,"end":257.76,"text":"We thought we'd start with paint.","words":[["We",255.82,256.14],["thought",256.14,256.46],["we'd",256.46,256.78],["start",256.78,257.08],["with",257.08,257.4],["paint.",257.4,257.76]]},{"start":258.42,"end":266.54,"text":"Yeah, we'll explain that we advise setting up schemes where you can take it to a centre to be used by people who need it.","words":[["Yeah,",258.42,258.78],["we'll",259.14,259.48],["explain",259.48,260.0],["that",260.0,260.28],["we",260.28,260.46],["advise",260.46,260.94],["setting",260.94,261.38],["up",261.38,261.64],["schemes",261.64,262.16],["where",262.16,262.64],["you",262.64,262.8],["can",262.8,262.98],["take",262.98,263.24],["it",263.24,263.48],["to",263.48,263.72],["a",263.72,263.84],["centre",263.84,264.26],["to",264.26,264.6],["be",264.6,264.76],["used",264.76,265.08],["by",265.08,265.36],["people",265.36,265.78],["who",265.78,266.0],["need",266.0,266.26],["it.",266.26,266.54]]},{"start":266.54,"end":272.46,"text":"repainting an elderly person's home, for example, like they do in many parts of the world.","words":[["repainting",266.54,267.6],["an",267.6,267.94],["elderly",267.94,268.28],["person's",268.28,269.06],["home,",269.06,269.34],["for",269.5,269.6],["example,",269.6,270.08],["like",270.56,270.78],["they",270.78,271.0],["do",271.0,271.18],["in",271.18,271.34],["many",271.34,271.58],["parts",271.58,271.92],["of",271.92,272.08],["the",272.08,272.16],["world.",272.16,272.46]]},{"start":272.7,"end":275.82,"text":"Yes. Which is a positive note to start on.","words":[["Yes.",272.7,273.0],["Which",273.54,273.86],["is",273.86,274.02],["a",274.02,274.14],["positive",274.14,274.4],["note",274.4,274.92],["to",274.92,275.2],["start",275.2,275.44],["on.",275.44,275.82]]},{"start":276.54,"end":278.86,"text":"And will you discuss batteries?","words":[["And",276.54,277.08],["will",277.08,277.72],["you",277.72,277.92],["discuss",277.92,278.34],["batteries?",278.34,278.86]]},{"start":279.42,"end":285.38,"text":"Definitely. They're so small that they're the simplest things to drop in a bin and forget.","words":[["Definitely.",279.42,279.9],["They're",280.54,280.88],["so",280.88,281.28],["small",281.28,281.96],["that",281.96,282.22],["they're",282.22,282.48],["the",282.48,282.58],["simplest",282.58,283.02],["things",283.02,283.68],["to",283.68,283.94],["drop",283.94,284.26],["in",284.26,284.46],["a",284.46,284.56],["bin",284.56,284.76],["and",284.76,285.0],["forget.",285.0,285.38]]},{"start":285.8,"end":290.96,"text":"And I think we should emphasise that people should have a storage container at home","words":[["And",285.8,286.08],["I",286.08,286.44],["think",286.44,286.7],["we",286.7,286.92],["should",286.92,287.1],["emphasise",287.1,287.92],["that",287.92,288.22],["people",288.22,288.58],["should",288.58,288.84],["have",288.84,289.02],["a",289.02,289.16],["storage",289.16,289.6],["container",289.6,290.32],["at",290.32,290.52],["home",290.52,290.96]]},{"start":290.96,"end":296.24,"text":"where they can put them until they've got enough to take to a central collection facility","words":[["where",290.96,291.62],["they",291.62,291.78],["can",291.78,292.0],["put",292.0,292.28],["them",292.28,292.6],["until",292.6,293.0],["they've",293.0,293.36],["got",293.36,293.44],["enough",293.44,293.82],["to",293.82,294.08],["take",294.08,294.28],["to",294.28,294.46],["a",294.46,294.56],["central",294.56,294.98],["collection",294.98,295.56],["facility",295.56,296.24]]},{"start":296.24,"end":298.96,"text":"because they're full of toxic substances.","words":[["because",296.24,297.0],["they're",297.0,297.34],["full",297.34,297.58],["of",297.58,297.76],["toxic",297.76,298.14],["substances.",298.14,298.96]]},{"start":299.82,"end":301.86,"text":"Medicines are really interesting.","words":[["Medicines",299.82,300.42],["are",300.42,300.66],["really",300.66,301.12],["interesting.",301.12,301.86]]},{"start":302.54,"end":305.92,"text":"I imagine people don't think of them as dangerous.","words":[["I",302.54,302.82],["imagine",302.82,303.36],["people",303.36,303.84],["don't",303.84,304.24],["think",304.24,304.52],["of",304.52,304.76],["them",304.76,305.02],["as",305.02,305.4],["dangerous.",305.4,305.92]]},{"start":306.28,"end":307.0,"text":"No, indeed.","words":[["No,",306.28,306.56],["indeed.",306.68,307.0]]},{"start":307.84,"end":312.34,"text":"The point we want to make is that, as a rule, things like antibiotics","words":[["The",307.84,308.08],["point",308.08,308.36],["we",308.36,308.6],["want",308.6,308.78],["to",308.78,309.0],["make",309.0,309.34],["is",309.34,309.64],["that,",309.64,309.92],["as",309.96,310.14],["a",310.14,310.24],["rule,",310.24,310.58],["things",311.1,311.24],["like",311.24,311.58],["antibiotics",311.58,312.34]]},{"start":312.34,"end":316.08,"text":"should not need to be thrown away in the first place","words":[["should",312.34,313.1],["not",313.1,313.32],["need",313.32,313.8],["to",313.8,314.1],["be",314.1,314.26],["thrown",314.26,314.48],["away",314.48,314.88],["in",314.88,315.12],["the",315.12,315.22],["first",315.22,315.5],["place",315.5,316.08]]},{"start":316.08,"end":321.0,"text":"Because doctors usually tell us we should finish off the whole course of tablets.","words":[["Because",316.08,316.76],["doctors",316.76,317.26],["usually",317.26,317.82],["tell",317.82,318.14],["us",318.14,318.4],["we",318.4,318.56],["should",318.56,318.76],["finish",318.76,319.06],["off",319.06,319.4],["the",319.4,319.6],["whole",319.6,319.9],["course",319.9,320.38],["of",320.38,320.52],["tablets.",320.52,321.0]]},{"start":321.48,"end":323.68,"text":"So there aren't any left to go for waste.","words":[["So",321.48,321.68],["there",321.68,321.84],["aren't",321.84,322.18],["any",322.18,322.36],["left",322.36,322.7],["to",322.7,322.96],["go",322.96,323.14],["for",323.14,323.34],["waste.",323.34,323.68]]},{"start":324.1,"end":325.3,"text":"Doubly good strategy.","words":[["Doubly",324.1,324.5],["good",324.5,324.76],["strategy.",324.76,325.3]]},{"start":326.22,"end":327.84,"text":"Are you discussing pesticides?","words":[["Are",326.22,326.5],["you",326.5,326.7],["discussing",326.7,327.26],["pesticides?",327.26,327.84]]},{"start":328.68,"end":334.76,"text":"Yes. The point we highlight from the article is that people are often unsure what to do with them.","words":[["Yes.",328.68,328.94],["The",329.46,329.64],["point",329.64,329.88],["we",329.88,330.16],["highlight",330.16,330.64],["from",330.64,331.02],["the",331.02,331.16],["article",331.16,331.6],["is",331.6,331.96],["that",331.96,332.14],["people",332.14,332.42],["are",332.42,332.7],["often",332.7,332.94],["unsure",332.94,333.56],["what",333.56,333.96],["to",333.96,334.16],["do",334.16,334.32],["with",334.32,334.54],["them.",334.54,334.76]]},{"start":335.04,"end":340.96,"text":"And there needs to be clearer information given on the packaging so people are left in no doubt.","words":[["And",335.04,335.28],["there",335.28,335.46],["needs",335.46,335.8],["to",335.8,336.06],["be",336.06,336.2],["clearer",336.2,336.64],["information",336.64,337.36],["given",337.36,337.9],["on",337.9,338.1],["the",338.1,338.24],["packaging",338.24,338.76],["so",338.76,339.42],["people",339.42,339.76],["are",339.76,339.96],["left",339.96,340.18],["in",340.18,340.38],["no",340.38,340.58],["doubt.",340.58,340.96]]},{"start":340.96,"end":349.94,"text":"We thought we'd also look at tyres. Rather than sending them to the dump, people should be encouraged to be creative with them.","words":[["We",340.96,341.74],["thought",341.74,342.0],["we'd",342.0,342.28],["also",342.28,342.7],["look",342.7,343.08],["at",343.08,343.4],["tyres.",343.4,343.9],["Rather",344.46,344.82],["than",344.82,345.1],["sending",345.1,345.48],["them",345.48,345.76],["to",345.76,345.96],["the",345.96,346.1],["dump,",346.1,346.48],["people",346.8,347.12],["should",347.12,347.34],["be",347.34,347.54],["encouraged",347.54,348.16],["to",348.16,348.56],["be",348.56,348.76],["creative",348.76,349.36],["with",349.36,349.72],["them.",349.72,349.94]]},{"start":350.06,"end":358.32,"text":"Not just sending them away to be re-cut for re-treads, but to make them into things like plant holders for your garden.","words":[["Not",350.06,350.42],["just",350.42,350.76],["sending",350.76,351.3],["them",351.3,351.6],["away",351.6,351.9],["to",351.9,352.16],["be",352.16,352.32],["re",352.32,352.6],["-cut",352.6,352.84],["for",352.84,353.16],["re",353.16,353.4],["-treads,",353.4,353.9],["but",354.32,354.54],["to",354.54,354.76],["make",354.76,355.02],["them",355.02,355.28],["into",355.28,355.52],["things",355.52,355.86],["like",355.86,356.22],["plant",356.22,356.74],["holders",356.74,357.4],["for",357.4,357.74],["your",357.74,357.88],["garden.",357.88,358.32]]},{"start":358.84,"end":363.84,"text":"Good, yeah. And will you mention any electrical appliances?","words":[["Good,",358.84,359.24],["yeah.",359.54,359.76],["And",360.52,361.02],["will",361.02,361.54],["you",361.54,361.72],["mention",361.72,362.14],["any",362.14,362.58],["electrical",362.58,363.24],["appliances?",363.24,363.84]]},{"start":364.46,"end":369.54,"text":"We've opted to finish with fridges, because this is actually a good news story.","words":[["We've",364.46,364.9],["opted",364.9,365.28],["to",365.28,365.6],["finish",365.6,365.9],["with",365.9,366.24],["fridges,",366.24,366.88],["because",367.12,367.48],["this",367.48,367.76],["is",367.76,367.88],["actually",367.88,368.26],["a",368.26,368.46],["good",368.46,368.7],["news",368.7,369.02],["story.",369.02,369.54]]},{"start":369.54,"end":374.4,"text":"The fact that we now have the capacity to use less dangerous materials.","words":[["The",369.54,370.1],["fact",370.1,370.4],["that",370.4,370.74],["we",370.74,370.9],["now",370.9,371.18],["have",371.18,371.42],["the",371.42,371.56],["capacity",371.56,372.06],["to",372.06,372.48],["use",372.48,372.74],["less",372.74,373.06],["dangerous",373.06,373.58],["materials.",373.58,374.4]]},{"start":374.82,"end":380.26,"text":"And we should continue to exploit that capacity to reduce effects on the ozone layer.","words":[["And",374.82,375.1],["we",375.1,375.34],["should",375.34,375.54],["continue",375.54,376.12],["to",376.12,376.38],["exploit",376.38,376.92],["that",376.92,377.24],["capacity",377.24,377.82],["to",377.82,378.2],["reduce",378.2,378.54],["effects",378.54,379.12],["on",379.12,379.42],["the",379.42,379.58],["ozone",379.58,379.82],["layer.",379.82,380.26]]},{"start":380.84,"end":383.92,"text":"Good. Well, that seems...","words":[["Good.",380.84,381.28],["Well,",382.18,382.54],["that",382.82,383.02],["seems...",383.02,383.92]]},{"start":383.92,"end":394.69,"text":"That is the end of Part 3. You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 3.","words":[["That",383.92,384.8],["is",388.61,388.77],["the",388.77,388.91],["end",388.91,389.29],["of",389.29,389.45],["Part",389.45,389.67],["3.",389.67,390.07],["You",391.03,391.33],["now",391.33,391.59],["have",391.59,391.91],["30",391.91,392.27],["seconds",392.27,392.65],["to",392.65,393.01],["check",393.01,393.31],["your",393.31,393.49],["answers",393.49,393.85],["to",393.85,394.13],["Part",394.13,394.31],["3.",394.31,394.69]]},{"start":394.69,"end":403.36,"text":"Part 4 You will hear part of a student presentation","words":[["Part",394.69,395.69],["4",399.24,399.64],["You",399.64,401.08],["will",401.08,401.3],["hear",401.3,401.58],["part",401.58,401.92],["of",401.92,402.1],["a",402.1,402.22],["student",402.22,402.5],["presentation",402.5,403.36]]},{"start":403.8,"end":410.3,"text":"about a field trip to a whale shark research center given to fellow marine biology students.","words":[["about",403.8,404.16],["a",404.16,404.44],["field",404.44,404.66],["trip",404.66,404.98],["to",404.98,405.34],["a",405.34,405.48],["whale",405.48,405.74],["shark",405.74,406.12],["research",406.12,406.58],["center",406.58,407.1],["given",407.1,407.88],["to",407.88,408.18],["fellow",408.18,408.46],["marine",408.46,408.98],["biology",408.98,409.42],["students.",409.42,410.3]]}]}